penness may affect crew cooperation. For D, his concentration and responsibility are strong, but his hot temper and being a loner could affect teamwork.\" Then maybe we still tentatively support B but want more discussion.\n\nWe must include vote. We can vote for B still, but note we need more info.\n\nThus produce public message with argument.\n\nLet's craft."}
