ng his vote (likely still B). Must follow guidelines.\n\nWe need to produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON with agent \"james_carter\". Vote likely Candidate B.\n\nLet's craft a concise argument: Agree with Emily, note that B's memory issue could be mitigated, but we need to evaluate D's hot temper and A's attitude. Suggest we discuss D's responsibility and hot temper, and A's anticipation vs attitude. Conclude still vote B.\n\nProceed."}
